#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Apply the Krylov method to the given matrix, selecting an appropriate new initial vector. Write down the estimates of the minimum eigenvalue at the 0th and 1st order of your Krylov subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle v_0|A|v_0\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{7}{3}\n"
